test: swap partition filesystem type must be swap

Ensures that fstab entries intended for swap partitions do not mistakenly use 'none' as their filesystem type.
-- input/etc/fstab --
UUID=ccd57c54-3caf-47ba-9137-cfd252dc8750 none none defaults 0 0
-- expected/validationerrors.txt --
Filesystem type for swap must be 'swap'
